&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;その他&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;（新株予約権の権利行使）&lt;/p&gt;
